Asu
$cards
DECK 1 SPADES

$initial
OQUIQ 10 FACE_HALF
OQUIQ 3 FACE_ALL

$moves
MOVE OQUIQ OQUIQ
DESTSRC Suit match_color
MOVE_STACK OQUIQ OQUIQ
OR
    AND
        DEST Suit {SPADES, DIAMONDS, HEARTS, CLUBS}
        DEST Suit {DIAMONDS, CLUBS}
    AND
        DEST Size > 6
        DESTSRC Suit match_color
$win
PILE ALL OQUIQ Empty
